# Prettier formats the code and config (npm run format). Left alone:
# - src/content.json: the admin writes it with JSON.stringify on every save, so formatting
#   it here would only be undone (and fail format:check) after the next save;
# - Markdown: the docs are wrapped by hand;
# - index.html: the build stamps each page's description and preview tags into copies of it
#   with regexes that expect each <meta> on one line (withMeta in src/seoPages.js), and
#   Prettier wraps the long ones;
# - assets, the public folder (it holds a built single-file game), the lockfile;
# - build, test and coverage output, and local scratch.
src/content.json
/index.html
*.md
public/
assets/
package-lock.json
dist/
admin/dist/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.scratch/
review/
